For the SMS version
This script utilizes the Twilio API to check the forecast and send a text message directly to your mobile phone if rain or precipitation is detected in the forecast window.

Changes to make for SMS:
Set up a Twilio account and populate the .env file with your Account SID, Auth Token, and trial phone number.

If using a Twilio Trial account, ensure your destination phone number (MY_PHONE_NUMBER) is verified inside your Twilio console under Verified Caller IDs.

Update lat and lon to your desired geographic coordinates.
